```
# Rust compilation artifacts
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp

# IDE specific
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Python cache (if any Python files exist in the project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
```